{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"TicketYa — Ventas, reservas, compras y pagos","description":"Disponibilidad comercial por sector, reservas temporales con TTL,\ncompras idempotentes, pagos mock y reintentos.\nEl API Gateway valida el JWT y propaga X-User-Id; este microservicio\nfiltra reservas/compras/pagos por la identidad recibida.\n","contact":{"name":"Equipo TicketYa — TUDAi 2026","email":"equipo@ticketya.com.ar"},"license":{"name":"Uso académico — TUDAi 2026"},"version":"1.0.0"},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:8083","description":"Local — directo al microservicio"},{"url":"http://localhost:8080/api","description":"Local — vía API Gateway (StripPrefix=1)","x-gateway":true},{"url":"https://ticketya.com.ar/api","description":"Producción — vía API Gateway","x-gateway":true}],"tags":[{"name":"Ventas","description":"Disponibilidad, reservas, compras, pagos y cupos comerciales."},{"name":"Reportes","description":"Reportes del organizador sobre sus eventos: ventas, devoluciones, ocupación y recaudación."},{"name":"Fila virtual","description":"Ingreso, posición, estado, tandas y token de alta demanda."}],"paths":{"/reservas":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Crear reserva temporal","description":"Reserva cupo por sector con TTL (10 min por defecto). El cliente sale de\nX-User-Id. `Idempotency-Key` es opcional: si se repite, devuelve la reserva\nya creada para esa key.\nEn eventos de alta demanda, `tokenFila` se consume antes de `lockCupo` (409 sin/inválido, 503 si Redis falla).\n","operationId":"crearReserva","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","description":"Clave de idempotencia opcional para reintentos seguros","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"reserva-2026-03-14-0001"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReservaCreateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Reserva creada","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Reserva"}}}},"400":{"description":"Body inválido o sin precio activo","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Cupo insuficiente, límite por cliente o token de fila inválido/requerido","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"x-error-codes":["FILA_TOKEN_REQUERIDO","FILA_TOKEN_INVALIDO"]},"503":{"description":"FILA_NO_DISPONIBLE: Redis caído en evento de alta demanda","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"},"example":{"timestamp":"2026-11-19T15:20:00Z","status":503,"error":"Service Unavailable","message":"La fila no está disponible","code":"FILA_NO_DISPONIBLE"}}},"x-error-codes":["FILA_NO_DISPONIBLE"]}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reservas/{id}/renovacion":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Renovar reserva","description":"Extiende el TTL de una reserva propia activa (no es automática ni ilimitada).","operationId":"renovar","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID de la reserva","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Reserva renovada","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Reserva"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Reserva inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Reserva no activa o expirada","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reservas/{id}/confirmacion":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Confirmar reserva","description":"Marca la intención de compra. Solo reservas propias y activas.","operationId":"confirmar","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID de la reserva","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Reserva confirmada","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Reserva"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Reserva inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Estado o expiración no permiten confirmar","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reservas/{id}/cancelacion":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Cancelar reserva","description":"Cancela una reserva propia y libera el cupo. No cancelable con compra en curso o aprobada.","operationId":"cancelar","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID de la reserva","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Reserva cancelada","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Reserva"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Reserva inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Compra en curso/aprobada; no cancelable","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/pagos/{id}/reintentos":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Reintentar pago rechazado","description":"Solo se reintenta un pago RECHAZADO y una compra reintentable. Body opcional.","operationId":"reintentar","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID del pago","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PagoCreateRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Pago reintentado","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pago"}}}},"400":{"description":"Resultado inválido","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Pago inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Pago no RECHAZADO, compra no reintentable o sin reserva activa","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/eventos/{id}/cupos":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Abrir cupos comerciales del evento","description":"Crea/asegura el stock por sector al publicar. Idempotente por (idEvento, idSector):\nsi el cupo ya existe no resetea vendido/reservado.\nUso principal: Feign desde msvc-eventos; vía gateway requiere ORGANIZADOR o ADMIN.\n","operationId":"abrirCupos","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID del evento","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AbrirCuposRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Cupos abiertos/asegurados","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Disponibilidad"}}}},"400":{"description":"Body inválido o sin sectores","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflicto al abrir el cupo","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/eventos/{id}/cupos/liberacion":{"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Liberar cupo por devolución","description":"Devuelve unidades al disponible del sector (devolución aprobada).\nUso principal: Feign desde msvc-entradas; vía gateway requiere ORGANIZADOR o ADMIN.\n","operationId":"liberarCupo","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID del evento","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LiberarCupoRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Cupo liberado","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Disponibilidad"}}}},"400":{"description":"Body inválido (idSector/cantidad)","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Sector sin cupo comercial","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/compras":{"get":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Listar compras propias","description":"Compras del usuario autenticado.","operationId":"listCompras","responses":{"200":{"description":"Compras del usuario","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Compra"}}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]},"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Crear compra desde una reserva","description":"Convierte una reserva válida en compra. `Idempotency-Key` es **obligatoria**\n(400 si falta); repetir la key devuelve la compra ya creada.\n","operationId":"crearCompra","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","description":"Clave de idempotencia obligatoria","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"compra-2026-03-14-0001"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CompraCreateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Compra creada","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Compra"}}}},"400":{"description":"Falta Idempotency-Key o body inválido","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Reserva inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"Reserva no activa o ya usada en otra compra","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/compras/{id}/pagos":{"get":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Listar pagos de una compra","description":"Pagos registrados para una compra propia.","operationId":"listPagos","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID de la compra","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Pagos de la compra","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pago"}}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Compra inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]},"post":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Iniciar pago de una compra","description":"Pago mock: `resultado` APROBAR (default) o RECHAZAR; `proveedor` opcional\n(default MOCK_PASARELA). Body opcional. Con APROBAR se dispara la emisión\nde entradas en msvc-entradas (reintentos + job).\n","operationId":"pagar","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID de la compra","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PagoCreateRequest"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Pago registrado","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pago"}}}},"400":{"description":"Resultado inválido","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Compra inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"409":{"description":"La compra no admite pago en su estado","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reservas/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Ventas"],"summary":"Consultar reserva propia","description":"Solo devuelve reservas del usuario autenticado.","operationId":"getReserva","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","description":"UUID de la reserva","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Reserva","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Reserva"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"404":{"description":"Reserva inexistente o de otro usuario","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reportes/eventos/{idEvento}":{"get":{"tags":["Reportes"],"summary":"Reporte completo del evento","description":"Totales y detalle por sector (ventas, devoluciones, ocupación y recaudación). ORGANIZADOR dueño del evento o ADMIN. Importes y conteos según las definiciones de ReporteEvento.","operationId":"reporte","parameters":[{"name":"idEvento","in":"path","description":"UUID del evento","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Reporte","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteEvento"}}}},"401":{"description":"Falta X-User-Id","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteEvento"}}}},"403":{"description":"No es ADMIN ni el organizador del evento","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteEvento"}}}},"404":{"description":"Evento inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteEvento"}}}},"503":{"description":"No se pudo consultar eventos o entradas","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteEvento"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reportes/eventos/{idEvento}/ventas":{"get":{"tags":["Reportes"],"summary":"Ventas del evento","description":"Compras aprobadas y entradas vendidas, devueltas, vigentes e ingresadas. ORGANIZADOR dueño del evento o ADMIN. Importes y conteos según las definiciones de ReporteEvento.","operationId":"ventas","parameters":[{"name":"idEvento","in":"path","description":"UUID del evento","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Ventas","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteVentas"}}}},"403":{"description":"No es ADMIN ni el organizador del evento","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteVentas"}}}},"404":{"description":"Evento inexistente","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReporteVentas"}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}]}},"/reportes/eventos/{idEvento}/sectores":{"get":{"tags":["Reportes"],"summary":"Ventas y devoluciones por sector","description":"Una fila por sector con vendidas, devueltas, ocupación y recaudación. ORGANIZADOR dueño del evento o ADMIN. Importes 